  "summary": "A multi-layered ticketing scam targeting Celine Dion fans in France, combining social-engineering on Facebook fan groups with fraudulent Shopify-hosted websites impersonating AXS, Ticketmaster and the artist herself. All fake sites share one phishing kit, evidenced by the identical low-entropy 'hWNA' OAuth state prefix, reused Shopify client IDs and a repurposed en-GB locale parameter. Fraudulent payments are taken via a subdomain 'pay.' page or direct peer-to-peer bank transfer, while the same Ticketmaster digital ticket is resold to multiple victims.",
